<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Lamba Doria</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1245–<a href="/years/1323">1323</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/13th-century">13th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Lamba Doria (1245–1323) was a Genoese admiral and statesman of the powerful <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/doria-family">Doria family</a>. In 1298 he commanded the Genoese fleet that destroyed a Venetian fleet at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-curzola">Battle of Curzola</a> in the Adriatic, the greatest Genoese naval victory over its rival. His brother <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oberto-doria">Oberto Doria</a> had won at Meloria against <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pisa">Pisa</a> in 1284.</p></div>
